The duties of the scrutineers shall be —

(a) to ensure compliance with paragraphs 16 and 17 of the Order on the eligibility of practitioner members to be candidates for elections to the Council;

(b) to ensure compliance with paragraph 18 of the Order with regard to the eligibility of practitioner members to make nominations, making and publishing a list of all practitioners setting out —

(i) the years on standing of every practitioner members;

(ii) the nationality of the practitioner members and whether they are persons to whom a Residence Permit has been granted under regulations made under the Immigration Act (Chapter 17);

(iii) those practitioner members who are eligible to nominate or be nominated for election,

(c) to verify that nominations of candidates received are in compliance with the Order and to reject any nomination in breach thereof;

